# GNU Stow options for this repository.
#
# Stow reads ./.stowrc automatically when run from this directory, so the
# options below apply to `make` as well as to manual commands such as
# `stow --restow kitty`.
#
# --ignore patterns are Perl regexes matched against the end of each path.
# They are added on top of Stow's built-in default ignore list (which already
# skips .git, .gitignore, README*, LICENSE*, editor backups, ...).
# Avoid per-package .stow-local-ignore files: one of those replaces the
# built-in defaults for its package instead of extending them.

--target=~

# macOS Finder metadata
--ignore=\.DS_Store

# Karabiner-Elements automatic backups (machine-local, not versioned)
--ignore=automatic_backups
